[en.FOCUS_C12_TECHNOLOGY_OF_ANOTHER_WORLD]
Technology of Another World

[en.FOCUS_C12_TECHNOLOGY_OF_ANOTHER_WORLD_desc]
Sunset Shimmer claimed she came from another world with far more advanced technology—one where steam was never used and a single bomb could obliterate several square kilometers of land. Since she is more than willing to offer us technical assistance, we should accept it.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TECHNOLOGY_OF_ANOTHER_WORLD]
另一世界的科技

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TECHNOLOGY_OF_ANOTHER_WORLD_desc]
余晖烁烁声称她来自另外一个科技更加发达的世界，那里从不使用蒸汽，只需一枚炸弹就能摧毁数平方公里的土地，既然她很乐意为我们提供一些技术上的帮助，我们就应该接受这一点。

